  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s1",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "___ with h/o severe Cdiff requiring ICU admission in ___, who \npresents with abdominal pain and diarrhea x 1 day.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14254559-DS-24:chars=6148-6261",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s2",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "# Abdominal pain and diarrhea: Given the history of constipation \nprior to diarrhea and some relief of abdominal pain and bloating \nwith diarrhea, the patient presentation was most consistent with \noverflow diarrhea.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14254559-DS-24:chars=6263-6479",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s3",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "However, given her history of severe C diff, \nthis could also represent recurrent C diff.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14254559-DS-24:chars=6480-6569",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s4",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "KUB was reassuring \nand did not show any megacolon or obstruction.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14254559-DS-24:chars=6571-6637",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s5",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "She was initially \ntreated empirically for C diff with PO Vancomycin 125mg Q6H.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14254559-DS-24:chars=6638-6717",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s6",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Cdiff was tested and was negative and vancomycin was \ndiscontinued.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14254559-DS-24:chars=6719-6786",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s7",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "She did not have a bowel movement after admission \nand was complaining of abdominal discomfort.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14254559-DS-24:chars=6788-6883",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s8",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "She was placed on a \nbowel regimen with senna, miralax and dulcolax PR and still did \nnot have a bowel movement.",
